#Actif Events Informations File
	 #Type: The central atom's type.
	 #Central Atom: Index of the central atom of the event.
	 #Ref Event: Index of reference event in the reference table.
	 #dE forward: Energy barrier of the forward reaction (eV).
	 #dE backward: Energy barrier of the backward reaction (eV).
	 #dE asym: |dE forward - dE backward| (eV).
	 #k: rate of the forward reaction (ps-1)
	 #dra_i: displacement between the initial positions and the saddle positions.
	 #dra_f: displacement between the final positions and the saddle positions.
	 #Refined: - T : The event has been refined.
	 #         - F : The event has not been refined.

